# The log of the test must have a line for each of these patterns (grep -E).
\[8\.50\].* inv count=6 WeaponCrowbar AmmoNone MedKit WeaponPistol Ammo10mm NanoKeyRing
# A click selects the medkit: its button is at the second place of the grid, and the info window has its name.
\[12\.00\].* PersonaInventoryItemButton x=53 y=0 w=54 h=54
\[12\.00\].* PersonaHeaderTextWindow .* text="Medkit"
\[12\.10\].* Harness: cursor DeusExCursor2 hot=32,32 .* shadow=DeusExCursor2_Shadow
# During the drag, the picture of the item is the cursor.
\[13\.40\].* Harness: cursor LargeIconMedKit .* shadow=none
# After the drop, the button is two rows lower, and the arrow is the cursor again.
\[14\.20\].* PersonaInventoryItemButton x=53 y=106 w=54 h=54
\[14\.30\].* Harness: cursor DeusExCursor2 
